@startuml USEI12 - System Sequence Diagram

actor "Infrastructure Planner" as Planner
participant ":System" as System

Planner -> System : request minimal backbone network computation
activate System
System --> Planner : minimal backbone network
deactivate System

Planner -> System : request network visualization
activate System
System --> Planner : visualization files (DOT and SVG)
deactivate System

@enduml
